        "Description": "That nonsense with The Agency is finally over, and we can get back to normal contracts. You have three targets, today. The head managers for both the Kowoon and Thrasher racing teams, as well as the lead Kronstadt mechanic. Our client would like to delay todays race as much as possible, and they think that if we take out the most important part of each racing teams, they will call of the race until another day.\rPart 5 in a series of contracts",
